Value SLOT (\S+)
Value CARD (\S+)
Value SENSOR (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value TEMPERATURE (\S+)
Value LOWER (\S+)
Value LOWER_RESUME (\S+)
Value UPPER (\S+)
Value UPPER_RESUME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Slot\s+Card\s+Sensor\s+Status
  ^\s*-+
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+${CARD}\s+${SENSOR}\s+${STATUS}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+${LOWER}\s+${LOWER_RESUME}\s+${UPPER}\s+${UPPER_RESUME}\s*$$ -> Record
